1
00:00:00,056 --> 00:00:04,657
Putri duyung ternyata pernah
"ditangkap" di Maluku zaman VOC...

2
00:00:04,657 --> 00:00:05,710
dan konon,

3
00:00:05,710 --> 00:00:08,137
suaranya mencicit seperti tikus!

4
00:00:08,137 --> 00:00:11,110
Pelukis VOC memeliharanya
di bak air di Ambon.

5
00:00:11,110 --> 00:00:13,048
4 hari 7 jam...

6
00:00:13,048 --> 00:00:14,478
ia menolak makan,

7
00:00:14,478 --> 00:00:15,325
lalu mati.

8
00:00:15,325 --> 00:00:16,971
Lukisannya terbit di Amsterdam,

9
00:00:16,971 --> 00:00:18,429
bikin Eropa berdebat.

10
00:00:18,429 --> 00:00:19,135
Kini,

11
00:00:19,135 --> 00:00:21,665
peneliti menduga kisah itu dikarang.

12
00:00:21,665 --> 00:00:24,506
Mitos putri duyung diduga
lahir dari dugong...

13
00:00:24,506 --> 00:00:26,190
yang di sini disebut...

14
00:00:26,190 --> 00:00:27,065
duyung!

15
00:00:27,065 --> 00:00:27,667
Follow,

16
00:00:27,667 --> 00:00:29,973
besok ada yang lebih aneh.
